**How it meets the acceptance criteria:**
- **Dated source ledger for all five core apps** — `ERC` record contract carrying `claimed_date`, `claimed_country`, `claim_origin`, and a `verification_source` pointing to a dated `EVD` record (TASK-005). All five apps (APP-001…005) registered.
